{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022225250906-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022230854\"/><p>巴青縣發生地震。</p><p>西藏那曲市巴青縣周四（22日）晚上10時33分發生黎克特制7級地震，震源深度10公里。震央位於北緯32.40度，東經93.79度。</p><p>地震周邊5公里內的村莊有冷達、普欽村、改迦哢村，20公里內的鄉鎮有崗切鄉、瑪如鄉。震央距那曲市194公里，距拉薩市399公里。震央5公里範圍內平均海拔約4,864米，周邊200公里內近5年來發生3級以上地震共54次。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.322852+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":191,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:52:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:15.435063+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:15.435063+00:00","content_hash":"8afc80a1411184fb2fab9d0a48c759f631376a068be17b6162f78dcc23b5c619","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}